on performance.

- A missing aspect of the experimental setup is the modeling of inter-tile =
communication. More details are needed to ensure reproducibility and proper=
ly contextualize the results.

- In the experimental setup, there is no mention of random seed control or =
variability between runs, which are important details as MCPT is stochastic=
.

- The authors describe how they measured the power for FluxArch but not for=
